# Rename All Categories to Back

Status: DONE
Milestone: M56 Plain Back label for returning from a notebook
Dependencies: 54_ORDER_ACTION_LABEL.todo, 55_CENTERED_CAKE_LABELS.todo

## Purpose

Rename the category-return action while preserving its behavior and distinguishing
it accessibly from the existing previous-page Back button.

## Tasks

- [x] Rename the modal button and six static links to Back.
- [x] Use accessible name Back to cake categories; preserve previous-page name.
- [x] Verify all six keyboard returns, focus restoration and noJS links.
- [x] Run relevant UI checks and refresh affected current artwork.
- [x] Publish scoped output and update docs/context.

## Acceptance criteria

- Visible Back label; no All categories label in current generated markup.
- Modal Back closes to the covers and restores its opener's focus.
- Page Back stays inside the book; static Back links still target#cakes.
- No controller, colour, typography, product-media or local4174changes.

